@context: MOCK answers matching requests from a file. A rule lasts for the rest of the session, across navigations — so this hunt runs last.
@title: mocking
@tags: regression, network

STEP 1: Serve the catalog from a fixture
    MOCK GET "/api/products" with '../mocks/products.json'
    NAVIGATE to {base_url}/catalog.html
    VERIFY that 'Mocked Yurt' is present
    VERIFY that 'Loaded 2 products' is present
    VERIFY that 'Steppe Map' is NOT present
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Mocked Tea'
    VERIFY 'Cart total' field has value '3.50'

DONE.
